s the new strength of the club?", "options": [{"text": "425", "added": false}, {"text": "475", "added": false}, {"text": "405", "added": false}, {"text": "450", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": "475"}, {"n": 33, "text": "If the radius of the base of a right circular cylinder is decreased by 32% and its height is increased by 168%, then what is the percentage increase (closest integer) in its volume?", "options": [{"text": "24%", "added": false}, {"text": "6%", "added": false}, {"text": "23%", "added": false}, {"text": "46%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cylinder", "key_answer": "24%"}, {"n": 34, "text": "6 men can complete a piece of work in 10 days while 3 women can do it in 14 days. In how many days can 7 women and 5 men complete it?", "options": [{"text": "6 days", "added": false}, {"text": "4 days", "added": false}, {"text": "7 days", "added": false}, {"text": "8 days", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": "4 days"}, {"n": 35, "text": "A 214 m long train crosses a man walking at a speed of 5.7 km/h in the opposite direction in 9 seconds. What is the speed (in km/h) of the train?", "options": [{"text": "79.9", "added": false}, {"text": "82.8", "added": false}, {"text": "83.7", "added": false}, {"text": "84.3 Section : General Intelligence and Reasoning", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Trains", "sub": "train-vs-platform", "key_answer": "79.9"}]}